<title>BANGLADESH: Chittagong port handles 12,819 tonnes of cargo.</title>
<headline>Chittagong port handles 12,819 tonnes of cargo.</headline>
<dateline>CHITTAGONG, Bangladesh 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh's main Chittagong port handled 12,819 tonnes of export and import cargo in 24 hours ending 1 p.m. (0700 GMT) on Monday compared with 7,336 tonnes in the same period on Sunday, port officials said.</p>
<p>Cargo handling in tonnes:</p>
<p>					Monday		  Previous</p>
<p>    Export cargo		   1,066		   2,194</p>
<p>    Import cargo		  11,753		   5,142</p>
<p>Berthing schedule of major vessels unloading or expected to unload at Chittagong port:</p>
<p>    Commodity	   Tonnes	 Ship	     Berthing</p>
<p> Cement		   27,763     Global Jane	15/10</p>
<p> Fertilizer	     14,400     Safar		15/10</p>
<p> Sugar		    13,722     Tasmia	     20/10</p>
<p> Wheat		    25,000     Kea		  21/10</p>
<p>-- Dhaka Newsroom 880-2-506363</p>
</text>
